  "I vibe-coded this while spending a lot of time sitting with my mom in hospital. She's been a devoted Buddhist for a very long time (皈依 many years ago), and 抄心經 is close to her heart. I wouldn't call myself a Buddhist, more someone slowly learning about it, and this gave me something calm to do while I'm here.": "I vibe-coded this while spending a lot of time sitting with my mom in hospital. She's been a devoted Buddhist for a very long time (皈依 many years ago), and 抄心经 is close to her heart. I wouldn't call myself a Buddhist, more someone slowly learning about it, and this gave me something calm to do while I'm here.",
  "A few months ago I'd got her an e-ink tablet for reading, and sitting beside her it became my 抄經 tablet. It started as \"I just want a nice way to 抄心經 on this\" and, well, it grew a bit. 😅": "A few months ago I'd got her an e-ink tablet for reading, and sitting beside her it became my 抄经 tablet. It started as \"I just want a nice way to 抄心经 on this\" and, well, it grew a bit. 😅",
  "嗨，我是 Tim。這個小工具，是我在醫院陪媽媽的日子裡慢慢做出來的。媽媽是虔誠的佛教徒，很多年前已經皈依；我自己不算是佛教徒，只是在慢慢學習。幾個月前買給媽媽看書的電子墨水平板，後來成了我在她身邊抄經的字帖。": "嗨，我是 Tim。这个小工具，是我在医院陪妈妈的日子里慢慢做出来的。妈妈是虔诚的佛教徒，很多年前已经皈依；我自己不算是佛教徒，只是在慢慢学习。几个月前买给妈妈看书的电子墨水平板，后来成了我在她身边抄经的字帖。",
  "隨喜 · If you like this app": "随喜 · If you like this app",
  "西方寺 Western Monastery (荃灣, Hong Kong) — where Mom spent so much of her time 禮佛. If you're ever in Hong Kong, it's a beautiful, peaceful place to visit; 隨喜 there in person if you like.": "西方寺 Western Monastery (荃湾, Hong Kong) — where Mom spent so much of her time 礼佛. If you're ever in Hong Kong, it's a beautiful, peaceful place to visit; 随喜 there in person if you like.",
  "西方寺 · 網站": "西方寺 · 网站",
  "如果這個小工具對你有幫助，歡迎隨喜捐助以上機構。🙏": "如果这个小工具对你有帮助，欢迎随喜捐助以上机构。🙏",
  "完整介紹 · GitHub": "完整介绍 · GitHub",
  "字型：文鼎 PL 中楷 AR PL UKai（Arphic Public License）；全字庫正楷體 TW-Kai、馬善政 Ma Shan Zheng、霞鶩文楷 LXGW WenKai（SIL OFL 1.1）。已裁切字集並改名，授權全文在 library/fonts/。": "字体：文鼎 PL 中楷 AR PL UKai（Arphic Public License）；全字库正楷体 TW-Kai、马善政 Ma Shan Zheng、霞鹜文楷 LXGW WenKai（SIL OFL 1.1）。已裁切字集并改名，授权全文在 library/fonts/。",
  "私隱：你寫的字只存在這部裝置。開啟時會匿名計一次到訪（GoatCounter，不用 cookie），只是想知道值不值得繼續花心思維護。瀏覽器設定「不追蹤」時不計。": "隐私：你写的字只存在这部设备。打开时会匿名计一次到访（GoatCounter，不用 cookie），只是想知道值不值得继续花心思维护。浏览器设置「不追踪」时不计。",
  "筆順資料：hanzi-writer-data／Make Me a Hanzi（取自文鼎 Arphic 字型，Arphic Public License，授權全文在 library/strokes/LICENSE）。筆順依資料集（大陸標準），部分繁體字可能與臺灣標準不同。": "笔顺数据：hanzi-writer-data／Make Me a Hanzi（取自文鼎 Arphic 字体，Arphic Public License，授权全文在 library/strokes/LICENSE）。笔顺依数据集（大陆标准），部分繁体字可能与台湾标准不同。",
